G4691.definition:
σπερμολόγος, -ον
 (σπέρμα, λέγω) 
a seed picker; 
 __(a) prop., of birds (Arist., Aristoph, al.); 
 __(b) in Attic slang, of an idler who lives on scraps picked up in the agora; hence, as subst., ὁ σ., an idle babbler: Act.17:18.†
 (AS)
